{
  "id": "merge-intervals",
  "difficulty": "medium",
  "title": "合并账户活跃区间",
  "descriptionLines": [
    "给定一组账户活跃时间区间 intervals，其中 intervals[i] = [start_i, end_i]。请合并所有有重叠（或端点相接）的区间，返回合并后的区间列表。",
    "",
    "要求：",
    "1. 两个区间若有公共部分（包括端点相等，如 [1,4] 和 [4,5]）则合并为一个区间。",
    "2. 返回的区间按起点升序排列。",
    "3. 区间保证 start_i <= end_i。",
    "",
    "函数签名：mergeIntervals(intervals)",
    "返回值示例：intervals = [[1,3],[2,6],[8,10],[15,18]] 时，[1,3] 与 [2,6] 重叠，返回 [[1,6],[8,10],[15,18]]"
  ],
  "functionName": "mergeIntervals",
  "paramNames": [
    "intervals"
  ],
  "approachExplanation": "先按区间起点排序，然后单趟扫描：维护当前区间 cur，若下一个区间的起点不超过 cur 的终点，说明重叠，把 cur 的终点扩展为两者终点的较大值；否则把 cur 推入结果，另起新区间。排序 O(n log n) + 扫描 O(n)。注意不要原地修改输入数组，避免副作用。",
  "referenceSolutionLines": [
    "function mergeIntervals(intervals) {",
    "  if (intervals.length === 0) return [];",
    "  const sorted = intervals.slice().sort((a, b) => a[0] - b[0]);",
    "  const out = [];",
    "  let cur = sorted[0].slice();",
    "  for (let i = 1; i < sorted.length; i++) {",
    "    if (sorted[i][0] <= cur[1]) {",
    "      if (sorted[i][1] > cur[1]) cur[1] = sorted[i][1];",
    "    } else {",
    "      out.push(cur);",
    "      cur = sorted[i].slice();",
    "    }",
    "  }",
    "  out.push(cur);",
    "  return out;",
    "}"
  ],
  "expectedOutputs": [
